[aimspice]
[description]
974
Inverter leakage - stacking comparison
.include p18_cmos_models_ff.inc

VDD vdd 0 0.1375

* Worst-case logic levels that follow VDD
EHI hi 0 vdd 0 0.75
ELO lo 0 vdd 0 0.25

* Normal inverter
.subckt invn y a vdd
MP y a vdd vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MN y a 0 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
.ends

* NMOS-stacked inverter
.subckt invs y a vdd
MP y a vdd vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MN1 y a s 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MN2 s a 0 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
.ends

* Double-stacked inverter
.subckt invd y a vdd
MP1 sp a vdd vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MP2 y a sp vdd PMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MN1 y a s 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
MN2 s a 0 0 NMOS W=0.18U L=0.36U
.ends

* Normal: input 0 and 1
VN0 vdd dn0 0
XN0 yn0 lo dn0 invn
VN1 vdd dn1 0
XN1 yn1 hi dn1 invn

* NMOS-stacked: input 0 and 1
VS0 vdd ds0 0
XS0 ys0 lo ds0 invs
VS1 vdd ds1 0
XS1 ys1 hi ds1 invs

* Double-stacked: input 0 and 1
VD0 vdd dd0 0
XD0 yd0 lo dd0 invd
VD1 vdd dd1 0
XD1 yd1 hi dd1 invd

[dc]
1
VDD
0.1
0.8
0.01
[ana]
1 2
0
1 1
1 1 0 5E-09
3
i(vd1)
i(vs1)
i(vn1)
0
1 1
1 1 0 3E-09
3
i(vd0)
i(vs0)
i(vn0)
[end]
